OL,3,GNEWSANo ban on standing up while
OL,4,Adrinking, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FStanding up in pubs and bars while
OL,7,Ftaking a drink is not going to be
OL,8,Fbanned in a seaside resort.
OL,10,FBlackpool Council made its position
OL,11,Fclear in response to reports that the
OL,12,Flocal authority was one of four
OL,13,Fconsidering restrictions on so-called
OL,14,Fvertical drinking -  standing while
OL,15,Fdrinking alcohol - in pubs and bars.
OL,17,FWestminster City Council is considering
OL,18,Fthe policy in order to discourage
OL,19,Fdrunkenness, by encouraging more
OL,20,Fseating and table service instead of
OL,21,Fopen bar space.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
