OL,3,GNEWSANo ban on standing up while
OL,4,Adrinking, council says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlackpool council said while it was not
OL,7,Fconsidering a ban on such activities,
OL,8,Fencouraging premises to provide a
OL,9,F"broader offering " had been part of
OL,10,Fits licensing police for about 10
OL,11,Fyears.
